new file mode 100644
index 0000000..dc19c86
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelogs/fragments/password-hash-bcrypt-ident.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+minor_changes:
+  - password_hash filter and password lookup - allow selecting and persisting the BCrypt ident with ``ident``.
diff --git a/docs/docsite/rst/user_guide/playbooks_filters.rst b/docs/docsite/rst/user_guide/playbooks_filters.rst
index d7907d1..9fcc3a7 100644
--- a/docs/docsite/rst/user_guide/playbooks_filters.rst
+++ b/docs/docsite/rst/user_guide/playbooks_filters.rst
@@ -1335,6 +1335,14 @@ Some hash types allow providing a rounds parameter::
     {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('sha256', 'mysecretsalt', rounds=10000) }}
     # => "$5$rounds=10000$mysecretsalt$Tkm80llAxD4YHll6AgNIztKn0vzAACsuuEfYeGP7tm7"
 
+For BCrypt hashes, use ``ident`` to select the version prefix (``2``, ``2a``, ``2y``, or ``2b``)::
+
+    {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('blowfish', ident='2a') }}
+    # => "$2a$..."
+
+The password lookup also accepts ``ident`` with ``encrypt=bcrypt`` and saves the selected value with its salt.
+Without ``ident``, the lookup uses ``2a`` for a new BCrypt password file.
+
 .. _other_useful_filters:
 
 Manipulating text
